OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAChelsea's World's End Estate to
OL,4,Aget #20m refurb
OL,5,
OL,6,FChelsea's World's End Estate has been
OL,7,Fearmarked for #20m worth of
OL,8,Frefurbishment.
OL,10,FKensington and Chelsea Council has
OL,11,Fproposed a scheme of work for the 750
OL,12,Fhomes in west London, set across seven
OL,13,Ftower blocks, which includes replacing
OL,14,Fsome of the kitchens and bathrooms,
OL,15,Froof renewals and redecoration of
OL,16,Fcommunal areas.
OL,18,FLeaseholders will have to contribute
OL,19,Ftowards the repairs, although the
OL,20,Famount has not yet been confirmed.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
